    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Weekly updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/b87524f88f5634c242857d02e424bdee.poster.avif?t=1741083294\" width=600 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/b87524f88f5634c242857d02e424bdee.webm?t=1741083294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/b87524f88f5634c242857d02e424bdee.mp4?t=1741083294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow for weekly updates and updated demo builds. Full patch notes daily in the Discord Channel that will show up in the Sunday updates.</p></p><br><h1>Classes</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soldier:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/a5850be1fcb83485f751dc21b6e5012e.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Versatile warrior that uses direct attacks, blocks, and positioning to overcome enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attunist:</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/07bb9b19ede57ca19f441c5990a48523.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Ranged attacker that relies on healing and killing goblins before they can attack to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craftsman:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/26f7ba81448b852d072d2641f8e1c48f.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span> Equipped with a shotgun and repeating crossbow that needs to be reloaded. His equipment behaves differently depending on which card is used to activate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BladeDancer:</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/d5ffde19e25a4a0de51bac660d909bff.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Once per round can change his stance to adapt to changes in the battle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to come. . .</h2></p><br><h1>Races</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixie:</h2> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/8555705be08baffa56b0feedff4a12cf.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Loves the taste of goblins and can heal when he defeats them with his unique card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Triceratops:</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/8c06f670f776e3efac2caf14c2c8101a.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Tougher than most, his unique card provides him with protection and can take down an attacking enemy before they land their blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sloth:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/b85f38e4767bbf7c7987504380cd74e3.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span> Only race that doesn't get movement gear. Starts off slow but can be customized to be one of the fastest characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SoulReaper:</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/629cc52f527319e54f278004aa4ee455.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Doesn't unlock any achievements, card, gear, or class upgrades. Instead absorbs the power of each goblin type. Can you defeat the finale with only starter cards and gear but buffed stats?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to come. . .</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Enemies</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goblin Spearman</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/87f443525df5d65ee32511b52158dc2d.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Most common enemy. Higher health, damage, lowest speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goblin Runner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/7e8f3953c716b7173dbad8a66d605a63.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Extremely fast and more likely to be able to move and attack the hero from beyond the hero's attack range. Starts out hitting like a wet noodle though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goblin Archer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/ebdbd02d965aa0016730df605414a7c5.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Moves to range and attacks. Lowest health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goblin Champion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/fa1aedcd35b670e9d405876ed5168e73.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Extremely tough goblin that hits hard. Only goblin with damage resistance ignoring some damage from every hero attack. Immune to stun.</p></p><br><h1>Finales</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dream Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/0539c3cff91f2adb4fddde488cea2338.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Cannot be directly engaged, summons swarms of goblins from out of range. Summons a goblin champion every time the hero strikes one down. Heroes are encouraged to use a build that can manage swarms of enemies using area of effect attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LavaMan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/8e0fd283719017cae5c9434e588442b7.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Only takes a maximum of one damage per hit. Reduces the hero's health and maximum health by a rising amount each round. Heroes are encouraged to use a build that can deal multiple hits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Illusionist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/ca3a170997f7776c88436997ecbc9466.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Vanishes at the start of his turn and when hit leaving behind a group of goblins. Only the first hit in a multi-hit attack will deal damage because of the vanishing. Heroes are encouraged to use a build with high mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/e979122a5839641aa3c07024bc38bdf7.avif?t=1741083294\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Retaliates against any attack with the same damage he took. On his turn hits players with the strength of the last hit against him. Punishes heroes with large damage, low health builds. Heroes are encouraged to use a build with good block or heal.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive</strong> into this thrilling single-player adventure that will put your strategic skills to the ultimate test! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/28638870c9c04d8f53274f6bb1cb67e9.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness</strong> an arsenal of cards activating powerful gear to unleash devastating effects and outwit increasingly formidable foes.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> treacherous dungeons filled with dangerous enemies and use your cards to attack, incapacitate, move, heal, or defend. Every turn, you'll make strategic choices to maximize damage, expand your area of effect, boost your movement, hit multiple targets, and unlock a myriad of special effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/2ef28adc70991693493d6e8ad5166005.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance</strong> both your gear and your cards. Between battles, dive into a rich upgrade system that allows you to improve both your gear and your cards. Power up your attacks, broaden your strategic options, and adapt to the growing threats you'll face. As you level up, the enemies will rise to meet you with increased strength and cunning, but with each upgrade, you\u2019ll grow more formidable in return.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/d68455e15b97d50026b0738bcb0a676d.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span><strong>Master</strong> your deck, conquer the dungeons, and emerge victorious in this dynamic and engaging rogue-like experience where every decision counts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep card mechanics, evolving challenges, and endless replayability, Level Up Everything offers a dynamic and engaging rogue-like experience where every decision counts. Can you master the dungeons, and emerge victorious? The adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/36e62b80ff926ec4c0e21a54a123400e.avif?t=1741083294\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive</strong> into this thrilling single-player adventure that will put your strategic skills to the ultimate test! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/28638870c9c04d8f53274f6bb1cb67e9.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness</strong> an arsenal of cards activating powerful gear to unleash devastating effects and outwit increasingly formidable foes.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> treacherous dungeons filled with dangerous enemies and use your cards to attack, incapacitate, move, heal, or defend. Every turn, you'll make strategic choices to maximize damage, expand your area of effect, boost your movement, hit multiple targets, and unlock a myriad of special effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/2ef28adc70991693493d6e8ad5166005.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance</strong> both your gear and your cards. Between battles, dive into a rich upgrade system that allows you to improve both your gear and your cards. Power up your attacks, broaden your strategic options, and adapt to the growing threats you'll face. As you level up, the enemies will rise to meet you with increased strength and cunning, but with each upgrade, you\u2019ll grow more formidable in return.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/d68455e15b97d50026b0738bcb0a676d.avif?t=1741083294\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span><strong>Master</strong> your deck, conquer the dungeons, and emerge victorious in this dynamic and engaging rogue-like experience where every decision counts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its deep card mechanics, evolving challenges, and endless replayability, Level Up Everything offers a dynamic and engaging rogue-like experience where every decision counts. Can you master the dungeons, and emerge victorious? The adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210570/extras/36e62b80ff926ec4c0e21a54a123400e.avif?t=1741083294\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Bite sized solo dungeon delve. Use cards to activate gear or special effects as you delve through dungeons. Attack, block, move, heal, and interact with the environment using the unique card &amp; gear activation system. After each delve upgrade your gear and cards to exploit powerful combos.",
